## Phase 2: Foundational (Blocking Prerequisites)

**Purpose**: Entities and the SQLite schema every user story's stores and the engine build on.

**⚠️ CRITICAL**: No user story work can begin until this phase is complete.

- [X] T003 [P] Create the `Song` entity in `sb/Songs/Song.cs` with fields `Title` (string,
  required), `Text` (string, required), `Writer` (string?, optional), `Melody` (string?,
  optional), `SingingOrderNumber` (int, required). Enforce data-model.md's validation rule
  verbatim: "`Title` and `Text` MUST be non-empty (whitespace-only counts as empty)."
- [X] T004 [P] Create the `LeafletFormat` enum in `sb/Leaflets/LeafletFormat.cs` with values
  `SingleColumn`, `MultiColumn` (data-model.md).
- [X] T005 [P] Create the `OrderingMode` enum in `sb/Ordering/OrderingMode.cs` with values
  `AsListed`, `SpaceEfficient` (data-model.md).
- [X] T006 [P] Create `SbIndexDatabase` in `sb/Index/SbIndexDatabase.cs`: opens (creating if
  absent) a SQLite database file via `Microsoft.Data.Sqlite`, and applies the exact schema from
  `contracts/storage-format.md` / research.md §13:
  ```sql
  CREATE TABLE documents (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, path TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE, filename TEXT NOT NULL);
  CREATE TABLE chapters (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT NOT NULL, document_id INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES documents(id), UNIQUE (document_id, name));
  CREATE TABLE songs (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT NOT NULL, singing_order_number INTEGER NOT NULL, chapter_id INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES chapters(id));
  ```
- [X] T007 [P] Create `DocumentIndexEntry` in `sb/Index/DocumentIndexEntry.cs` with fields `Id`
  (int), `Path` (string, required, unique — "Filesystem path to the document's main folder —
  user-chosen at `create` time (`--path`), not a fixed convention. Unique."), `Filename` (string,
  required — "Derived from `Path`'s folder name at create time.") per data-model.md.
- [X] T008 [P] Create `ChapterIndexEntry` in `sb/Index/ChapterIndexEntry.cs` with fields `Id`
  (int), `Name` (string, required — "Unique within `DocumentId`."), `DocumentId` (int, required
  — "a `ChapterIndexEntry` cannot exist without one (FR-014/FR-020)") per data-model.md.
- [X] T009 [P] Create `SongIndexEntry` in `sb/Index/SongIndexEntry.cs` with fields `Id` (int),
  `Name` (string, required), `SingingOrderNumber` (int, required — "unique across all songs
  sharing the same document (via `ChapterId` → `DocumentId`), per FR-016"), `ChapterId` (int,
  required — "a `SongIndexEntry` cannot exist without one (FR-015/FR-021)") per data-model.md.

**Checkpoint**: Foundation ready — user story implementation can now begin.

