  song's `\paragraph*{...}` includes its `Song.SingingOrderNumber` alongside its `Title` (FR-008;
  the field is already required on `Song` since T003, so there is no reason to defer this to a
  later story).

### Implementation for User Story 1

- [X] ~~T015~~ [P] [US1] Create the `Phrase` record in `sb/Formatting/Phrase.cs` with field `Text`
  (string). Enforce verbatim: "A `Phrase` is never empty; the splitter never produces
