  "`LeafletBuilder` MUST fail with a descriptive error if `sb/template-main.tex` is missing or
  does not contain the expected placeholder/insertion markers, rather than silently emitting a
  malformed document."
- [X] T024 [US1] Implement `SongOrderer` in `sb/Ordering/SongOrderer.cs` with `AsListed` support
  only (identity pass-through preserving input order — `SpaceEfficient` is added in US3); make
  T013 pass.
- [X] T025 [US1] Implement `LeafletBuilder.Build` in `sb/Leaflets/LeafletBuilder.cs` per
