## Phase 4: User Story 2 - Maintain valid document/chapter/song structure (Priority: P2)

**Goal**: Documents/chapters/songs can be created through the CLI with correct containment rules
(FR-013/014/015) and are tracked in the SQLite index so they can be located regardless of where
their folder lives (FR-018–FR-023).

**Independent Test**: Create a document with no chapters/songs (succeeds), attempt to add a song
before any chapter exists (rejected), add a chapter (succeeds), then add a song to it (succeeds);
move/delete a document's folder and confirm a mismatch is reported.

