**Purpose**: Apply the two changes from spec.md's 2026-09-26 Clarification (folded from an
updated `sb/specification.md`) to the already-implemented feature: (1) a song is now one
`<name>.yml` file, not a `<name>.txt` + `<name>.yml` pair, with its own `number`/`text`/`score?`
fields, and (2) Config (`AppConfig`/`ConfigLoader`/`sb config set`) is removed entirely, not
merely left unbuilt. See plan.md's Complexity Tracking (2026-09-26 re-check), research.md §9/§11/
§12, data-model.md's `Song` entity, and `contracts/storage-format.md`/`cli-commands.md`.

