## Phase 9: 2026-09-26 Delta 2 — main.tex as sole document storage; `--format` moves to `build`

**Purpose**: Apply the two changes from `/speckit-clarify`'s second 2026-09-26 round (spec.md's
two added Clarification bullets): (1) a document has no metadata file of its own — `main.tex`
(rendered from `sb/template-main.tex`, `{title}`/`{subtitle}` tokens) is written immediately at
`create` time, alongside an empty `Chapters/` folder, and is the sole source for `Title`/
`Subtitle` on every later read; (2) `--format` moves from `documents create` to `documents build`
since there is no persisted document default to override. See research.md §6/§9's 2026-09-26
updates, data-model.md's `Document`/`LeafletRequest`, and `contracts/cli-commands.md`/
`storage-format.md`.

