  `{subtitle}` tokens (was a literal `"\Huge\bf Title\\"` string match, with no subtitle handling
  at all): `Render(escapedTitle, escapedSubtitle, content)` substitutes both, and the new static
  `ParseTitleAndSubtitle(renderedMainTex)` recovers them by reversing the substitution via
  `LatexEscaper.Unescape`. Update `sb/template-main.tex`'s two placeholder lines to match. Add
  `sb/Tests/DocumentTemplateTests.cs` covering the round-trip (with and without a subtitle).
