## Phase 12: 2026-09-26 Delta 5 — remove phrase-splitting; trust the user's line breaks

**Purpose**: Apply the fifth `/speckit-clarify` round's change (spec.md's fifth bullet, same
Session 2026-09-26) — a functional-requirement-level change, not just planning: the system no
longer detects "musical phrases" via punctuation. Each of a song's own input lines becomes one
output line as-is; the system only introduces a line break of its own when a line is too wide for
the column (FR-004, unchanged). See spec.md's revised FR-003/User Story 1/SC-002, research.md §3's
2026-09-26 update, data-model.md's removed `Phrase`, and `contracts/latex-output-contract.md`.

